From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saikiran <bjsaikiran@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 08:10:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Look for the camera JNI libs in system_ext

COS17 resolves the camera app lib directory to /apex/com.oplus.camera.app/lib64
when that APEX exists and to /product/lib64 otherwise. The OTA ships no such
APEX, and we install the libs to /system_ext/lib64, so point the fallback
there. OplusFaceBeautyPreview builds its ProductJni probe from this path.
---
 .../ocs/camera/consumer/apsAdapter/adapter/ApsUtils.smali     | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/smali/com/oplus/ocs/camera/consumer/apsAdapter/adapter/ApsUtils.smali b/smali/com/oplus/ocs/camera/consumer/apsAdapter/adapter/ApsUtils.smali
index 92ba393..f019c7a 100644
--- a/smali/com/oplus/ocs/camera/consumer/apsAdapter/adapter/ApsUtils.smali
+++ b/smali/com/oplus/ocs/camera/consumer/apsAdapter/adapter/ApsUtils.smali
@@ -84,7 +84,7 @@
 
 .field private static final PROC_MEMINFO_PATH:Ljava/lang/String; = "/proc/meminfo"
 
-.field private static final PRODUCT_LIB_DIR:Ljava/lang/String; = "/product/lib64"
+.field private static final PRODUCT_LIB_DIR:Ljava/lang/String; = "/system_ext/lib64"
 
 .field public static final RECORDING:Ljava/lang/String; = "surface_key_recording"
 
@@ -960,7 +960,7 @@
     return-object v0
 
     :cond_0
-    const-string v0, "/product/lib64"
+    const-string v0, "/system_ext/lib64"
 
     return-object v0
 .end method
